# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Why: the repo stored a mix of CRLF and LF blobs, and on Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true) a checkout produced CRLF. oxfmt emits LF, so
# `npm run ci`'s `format:check` step reported "Format issues found in above 233
# files" — every file, including untouched ones — and the documented ci gate
# could never pass locally.
#
# One-time follow-up to rewrite the existing blobs (EOL-only change):
#   git add --renormalize .
* text=auto eol=lf
